* **Provide Resources for Help:** I can give you links to reputable organizations that offer support and information about drug abuse and addiction, such as:
    * **SAMHSA (Substance Abuse and Mental Health Services Administration):** [https://www.samhsa.gov/](https://www.samhsa.gov/)
    * **National Institute on Drug Abuse (NIDA):** [https://www.drugabuse.gov/](https://www.drugabuse.gov/)
    * **Partnership to End Addiction:** [https://drugfree.org/](https://drugfree.org/)

**Important Disclaimer:**

